Revision history of WwW-GenGenLib-L10N


0.00_00  2026-11-11
    + RdKw::WwW::GenGenLib::L10N: $LOCALEDIR, where the catalogs of
      the gengenlib text domain are (bytes, as the system spells
      it).  By default, share/locale under INSTALL_BASE or PREFIX;
      perl Makefile.PL LOCALEDIR=... says otherwise.
    + perl Makefile.PL LINGUAS="en zh" makes and installs those
      catalogs too (none, unless told), with msgfmt(1) if it is
      there, or Locale::Msgfmt if it is not.
    + mkintl.pl [-B BUILD] [LINGUAS=...] LOCALEDIR=...: a Makefile
      in BUILD (which must exist) that makes and installs only
      the catalogs (of LINGUAS, or all of po/), and only in
      LOCALEDIR, which it must be told.
    + make pot, make update-po: po/gengenlib.pot from the sources
      of gengenlib (in ../gengenlib), and the catalogs merged with
      it, for the maintainer.
    * Catalogs updated for %m (in place of %s for $!).
